<span class="kicker link sec-kicker">01 · Where it stands</span>

## Everything but the ledger export

The new card flow is live for all regions. Two tasks remain: the ledger export is in review, and the refund webhook is being rewritten.

<div class="tiles">
<div class="tile pass"><span class="kicker pass">Shipped</span><span class="t-title">Card flow</span><p>All regions since Tuesday.</p></div>
<div class="tile review"><span class="kicker review">In review</span><span class="t-title">Ledger export</span><p>Waiting on finance sign-off.</p></div>
<div class="tile run"><span class="kicker run">Working</span><span class="t-title">Refund webhook</span><p>Retries move to a queue.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="callout run"><span class="kicker">Watch</span>

Refunds over the old webhook still work, but retry inline. Expect duplicate notifications until the queue lands.

